{"id":"n53751-1-7","stage":5,"title":"떠돌아다니다 · 漂泊不定","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53751-1-7-1","ko":"승규는 방학 때 어디를 다녀온 거야?","zh":"承奎假期去哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"방학","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디를","meaning":"一个地方","explanation":"어디：一个地方；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"2","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀온","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3","entryId":"20207","definition":"学校里一个学期结束后在一定期间内停止课业；或那个期间。","pronunciation":["방ː학"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某种状况下。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"一个地方","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代没有向听话人表明的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/8ddb1a28e957ef57dffb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n53751-1-7-2","ko":"카메라를 들고 전국을 떠돌아다니며 풍경 사진을 찍고 왔대.","zh":"听说他带着相机走遍全国，拍风景去了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"카메라를","meaning":"照相机","explanation":"카메라：照相机；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"카메라","audio":"/audio/6e2b53040cd15b607281.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57332","senseId":"1","lemma":"카메라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들고","meaning":"带，提，拎","explanation":"들다：带，提，拎；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전국을","meaning":"全国","explanation":"전국：全国；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"전국","audio":"/audio/9269373d05d5697512ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62412","senseId":"1","lemma":"전국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떠돌아다니며","meaning":"漂泊不定，流离失所","explanation":"떠돌아다니다：漂泊不定，流离失所；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"떠돌아다니다","audio":"/audio/097538d451a0067ae481.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53751","senseId":"1","lemma":"떠돌아다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풍경","meaning":"风景，风光，景色，景致","explanation":"풍경：风景，风光，景色，景致","readings":[{"term":"풍경","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72392","senseId":"1","lemma":"풍경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사진을","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찍고","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔대.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6e2b53040cd15b60","term":"카메라","zh":"照相机","audio":"/audio/6e2b53040cd15b607281.mp3","entryId":"57332","definition":"照相用的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"带，提，拎","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"手里拿着。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"9269373d05d56975","term":"전국","zh":"全国","audio":"/audio/9269373d05d5697512ee.mp3","entryId":"62412","definition":"整个国家全体。","pronunciation":["전국"]},{"id":"097538d451a0067a","term":"떠돌아다니다","zh":"漂泊不定，流离失所","audio":"/audio/097538d451a0067ae481.mp3","entryId":"53751","definition":"没有确定的住所，到处走动。","pronunciation":["떠도라다니다"]},{"id":"64d560d21687616f","term":"풍경","zh":"风景，风光，景色，景致","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3","entryId":"72392","definition":"大自然或某一地区的美景。","pronunciation":["풍경"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"e1e4a89817058245","term":"찍다","zh":"拍，拍摄","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3","entryId":"63320","definition":"用照相机照射某个物品，把其样子移动到胶片上。","pronunciation":["찍따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/148b4bf41e170476815b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.257,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=53751","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":154,"sequenceScore":3.0837,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说他带着相机走遍全国，拍风景去了。","听说男朋友提出分手了？","承奎假期去哪儿了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说他带着相机走遍全国，拍风景去了。","承奎假期去哪儿了？","听说男朋友提出分手了？"],"answer":0}]}
